\par \pard\plain \ltrpar\s1\cf0{\*\hyphen2\hyphlead2\hyphtrail2\hyphmax0}\aspalpha\rtlch\af1\afs24\lang1031\ltrch\dbch\af1\langfe1031\hich\f1\fs24\lang2057\loch\f1\fs24\lang2057{\rtlch \ltrch\loch\f1\fs16\lang2057\i0\b0\fs16 For a long time, the sainthood in the magic forest of Wedok was an important strategic point. It had been ruled by the wise king Matthes. But as Matthes did a journey to the other end of the world some time ago, and wasn\'92t seen since, a quarrel was picked 
about this sainthood. The leader of a group of paladins of the blood church, the brave fighter Merten, claims the valley for himself. David, the commander of a group of paladins of the light church, was convinced of the contrary. So they decided, that the 
leader, who could hold the sainthood for a certain time, should rule over Wedok. Of cause only until the king was back...}
